      "heading": "Good to know",
      "q1_question": "How long does shipping take?",
      "q1_answer_html": "<p>Orders leave the facility within 1–3 business days (Mon–Fri), shipping is free, and delivery takes 8–12 business days from dispatch.</p>",
      "q2_question": "What is your return policy?",
      "q2_answer_html": "<p>You have 30 days from delivery to return any unworn item in its original condition. Contact us first for a return authorization. There are no restocking fees.</p>",
      "q3_question": "How do I find my size?",
      "q3_answer_html": "<p>Every product page has a size chart with the measurements for that specific style, since fit can vary between styles. Check the chart before you order, and get in touch if you're between sizes and want a hand picking one.</p>",
      "q4_question": "Where does my order ship from?",
      "q4_answer_html": "<p>Your order ships directly from our fulfillment facility. Every order arrives within the processing and delivery window above.</p>",
      "q5_question": "How can I track my order?",
      "q5_answer_html": "<p>As soon as your order ships, we'll email you a tracking number and link so you can follow it the whole way. You can also contact us with your order number for a status update any time.</p>"
