  "pdp_story": {
    "eyebrow": "Our approach",
    "heading": "Effortless, on purpose",
    "text_html": "<p>This is an edit, not a catalogue. A piece earns its place when it goes on without thinking and still looks considered at the end of a long day: colours that live happily next to each other, shapes that layer, nothing that waits for an occasion.</p><p>We would rather carry fewer things and stand behind each one: honest photography, sizing you can check before you buy, and prices we can explain. If something is not right, you write to us and a person writes back.</p>",
